<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>That's What I Like - Alan Walker Remix</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Bruno Mars, Alan Walker</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">That's What I Like (Alan Walker Remix)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1KtU0WCq472KzqCXgMOxkS</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.880" end="00:05.400">I got a condo in Manhattan</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.400" end="00:07.000">Baby girl, what's hatnin'?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.000" end="00:08.760">You and your ass invited</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.760" end="00:10.530">So gon' and get to clappin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.530" end="00:12.160">So pop it for a pimp</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.160" end="00:13.720">Pop, pop it for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.720" end="00:15.850">Turn around and drop it for a pimp</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.850" end="00:17.350">Drop, drop it for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.150" end="00:19.780">I'll rent a beach house in Miami</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.780" end="00:21.570">Wake up with no jammies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.570" end="00:23.260">Lobster tail for dinner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.260" end="00:24.770">Julio serve that scampi</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.770" end="00:26.560">You got it if you want it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.560" end="00:28.120">Got, got it if you want it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.120" end="00:29.910">Said you got it if you want it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.910" end="00:32.250">Take my wallet if you want it now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.250" end="00:36.240">Jump in the Cadillac, girl, let's put some miles on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.240" end="00:39.480">Anything you want, just to put a smile on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.480" end="00:42.550">You deserve it baby, you deserve it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.550" end="00:45.290">And I'm gonna give it to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.290" end="00:48.620">Gold jewelry shining so bright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.620" end="00:52.080">Strawberry champagne on ice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.080" end="00:55.430">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.430" end="00:59.280">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.280" end="01:02.850">Sex by the fire at night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.850" end="01:06.130">Silk sheets and diamonds all white</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.130" end="01:09.970">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.970" end="01:13.890">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.890" end="01:21.890" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.870" end="01:33.850">That's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.850" end="01:35.460">That's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.460" end="01:39.060">Strawberry champagne on ice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.060" end="01:40.950">That's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.950" end="01:43.060">That's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.060" end="01:45.620">I'm talkin' trips to Puerto Rico</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.620" end="01:47.190">Say the word and we go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.190" end="01:49.130">You can be my freaka</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.130" end="01:51.550">Girl, I'll be on fleek, mamacita</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.550" end="01:54.840">I will never make a promise that I can't keep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.840" end="01:57.980">I promise that you'll smile ain't gon' never leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.980" end="02:02.130">Jump in the Cadillac, girl, let's put some miles on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.130" end="02:05.320">Anything you want, just to put a smile on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.320" end="02:08.540">You deserve it baby, you deserve it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.540" end="02:11.200">And I'm gonna give it to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.200" end="02:14.490">Gold jewelry shining so bright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.490" end="02:18.070">Strawberry champagne on ice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.070" end="02:21.520">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.520" end="02:25.330">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.330" end="02:28.930">Sex by the fire at night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.930" end="02:32.410">Silk sheets and diamonds all white</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.410" end="02:35.990">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.990" end="02:39.380">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.380" end="02:47.380" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.110" end="02:57.530">Gold jewelry shining so bright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.530" end="03:00.970">Strawberry champagne all nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.970" end="03:04.750">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.750" end="03:08.420">Lucky for you, that's what I like, that's what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.420" end="03:12.420" /></div></body></tt>